Hi,

I've found several old posts dealing with support for this card, but =
things haven't changed as far as i now !

Some people have tried to contact EGOSYS, but with no result.
I just can't unterstand the situation : what is EGOSYS aim, at not =
providing the required informations ? It's an old product, and their new =
products line is good, I agree, but not very unique when compared to =
others. They dont seem to use more than secret VLSI architectures, and =
even ECHO has released the infos.

The only brand which makes more than innovative products is RME to me, =
and they seem to cooperate more than sincerely !

What a mess ! I might have to change my hardware just because of this, =
how stupid it is ! But I'd like to use stuff like Ardour, RoseGarden, =
... at a higher level than with my onboard crap!




